"P2608356758" "You launch a blast of death energy at your target. This causes cold and negative energy damage. Further, the affected target suffers from reduced chance to hit and lower resistance to additional cold and negative energy damage. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
"P1547465087" "-ToHit, -RES(Cold/Negative Energy), Chance for +EndCost"
// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P3375983751" "Your chance to hit has been reduced and your resistance against cold and negative energy attacks has been lowered. You may also suffer increased endurance costs."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P2330922898" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage, reducing your resistance to cold and negative energy and lowering your chance to hit."

