// Power Help Text :
"P2282620433" "You fire a mass of coalesced death energy at a single target. This mass explodes on reaching its destination, causing the target and those nearby to suffer its ill effects. In addition to cold and negative energy damage, the affected targets have reduced defense, regeneration and recovery."
// DisplayTargetShortHelp :
