// Power Help Text :
"P2149455381" "You fire a blast of death energy at a single opponent. This bolt causes cold damage and negative energy damage over time. Additionally, it lowers your chance to hit and both movement and combat speeds. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
