"P1627301359" "You are suffering negative energy damage over time and are losing endurance. Additionally, your chance to hit, movement speed and combat speed are all lowered. You may suffer increased endurance costs."
// Effect VictimHit Message :
"P3374605627" "{PlayerSource}'s {PowerName} chills you, causing {Damage} points of cold damage. Your movement and combat speeds have been reduced, along with your chance to hit."

