// Power Help Text :
"P706744226" "You freeze a single target in a mass of death energy. The target is held and suffers cold damage, as well as negative energy damage over time. The target also suffers lingering reductions in their movement and recharge speeds after the hold ends. Finally, the longer you remain in combat, the more likely you will sap the target's soul, causing them to suffer increased endurance cost for all powers."
