// DisplayTargetHelp :
"P184302998" "You have been caught in a mass of frozen death energy, causing you to be held and suffer negative energy damage over time. When the hold ends, you will suffer reduced movement and attack speeds. There is also the potential for your powers to cost more endurance to execute."
